{"359376818": {"document": "Jacob has $3000 to invest. He has decided to invest in his favorite clothing company and his favorite tech company. He has decided that the money invested in his favorite clothing company must be at least four times as much as the amount invested in his favorite tech company. He has also limited himself to invest at most $500 in his favorite tech company. If the money invested in his favorite clothing company earns 7% and the money invested in his favorite tech company earns 10%, how much should he invest in each to maximize his profit?", "vars": ["clothing company", "tech company"], "var_mentions": ["clothing company", "tech company", "clothing company", "tech company", "tech company", "clothing company", "tech company"], "params": ["four", "7%", "10%"], "var_mention_to_first_var": {"clothing company": "clothing company", "tech company": "tech company"}, "first_var_to_mentions": {"clothing company": ["clothing company", "clothing company", "clothing company"], "tech company": ["tech company", "tech company", "tech company", "tech company"]}, "obj_declaration": {"type": "objective", "direction": "maximize", "name": "profit", "terms": {"clothing company": "7%", "tech company": "10%"}}, "const_declarations": [{"type": "sum", "direction": "has", "limit": "3000", "operator": "LESS_OR_EQUAL"}, {"type": "xby", "x_var": "clothing company", "direction": "at least", "param": "four", "y_var": "tech company", "operator": "GREATER_OR_EQUAL"}, {"type": "upperbound", "direction": "at most", "limit": "500", "var": "tech company", "operator": "LESS_OR_EQUAL"}], "spans": [{"text": "has", "start": 6, "token_start": 1, "token_end": 1, "end": 9, "type": "span", "label": "CONST_DIR"}, {"text": "3000", "start": 11, "token_start": 3, "token_end": 3, "end": 15, "type": "span", "label": "LIMIT"}, {"text": "clothing company", "start": 68, "token_start": 15, "token_end": 16, "end": 84, "type": "span", "label": "VAR"}, {"text": "tech company", "start": 102, "token_s